{
  "title": "Vibrant Snappy Moroccan Kabanos Skewers",
  "description": "A malty and snappy solo dinner dish featuring Polish kabanos, infused oil, and Mediterranean friendly flavors, cooked to perfection on a tava griddle.",
  "cuisine": "Moroccan",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
